       "w": 7728,
       "h": 4347,
       "date": "2025-06-23",
       "desc": "\"Diane, a small town is not unlike a river—lots of hidden currents and eddies, each holding its own secret... If you ever find yourself in this neck of the woods, you must come here. It's a place where a step off the road means a step into the wild.\" - Dale Cooper"
